{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S02、S10 中，回忆带来的安稳和满足一度可以独立存在，无法留住亲密的痛楚暂时退到背景。\",\n    \"S09、S13 部分转向担心记忆本身逐渐淡去、思考如何保存这段经历，略微偏离亲密本身无法留住的核心。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S01、S04-S07 的主要矛盾偏向袒露喜欢、害怕显得太黏、担心被嫌弃，以及确认对方是否同样需要自己，主线变成了关系中的自我暴露与相互确认。\",\n    \"S08-S14 进一步围绕未来是否会被需要、能否得到长久保证，以及如何避免将来受伤展开。痛楚主要来自对关系失去和不被需要的预期，而不是亲密的幸福与无法留住这份幸福本身难以分开。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X 从头到尾主要围绕已经发生的亲密展开：回忆使幸福重新变得真切，而无法复得又使这份幸福本身带上痛楚，两者反复交织、相互加深。Y 虽然也同时有亲密的快乐与失去的忧虑，但主线逐渐转向袒露心意、确认彼此需要和寻求未来保证，是与 Center 相近但不同的一件事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "65fc29ba-80ed-4f06-980a-25fba8a85021", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T075438852294Z", "elapsed_seconds": 15.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:54:54.559247+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "21241160d8e6511b6ac96a3bd62686c8a32c9d0967fa58ffd6c9abccbe1fa6cb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed